    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>You decide which side of you is the wall.</em></p><p><strong>Reaction.</strong> When a creature within 1 square of you attempts to move past you (toward a square that would put you between it and where it came from), you may spend <strong>1 Surge</strong> as a reaction. Its movement simply ends in its current square — no attack roll, no defense check. It has not yet spent the movement and may retreat or take a different path next turn.</p><p><strong>Limit:</strong> once per target per encounter. Use the ▶ button with the creature targeted.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
